orthant 1 language

- # `↯/s.15.1` — `Error.Unchecked`
+ # `↯/s.15.1` — `Error.Unchecked`

- Raised when a non-Soundness `Throwable` must be wrapped as an
- `Error`.
+ Se lanza cuando un `Throwable` ajeno a Soundness debe envolverse como `Error`.

- ## Cause
+ ## Causa

- `Error.apply(throwable)` either passes through an existing `Error`
- or wraps a foreign throwable in `Error.Unchecked`. The wrapper
- preserves the original message (or notes its absence) and the
- stack trace from the original throwable.
+ `Error.apply(throwable)` deja pasar un `Error` existente o envuelve un throwable ajeno en
+ `Error.Unchecked`. El envoltorio conserva el mensaje original (o deja constancia de que no lo hay)
+ y la traza de pila del throwable original.

- ## Example messages
+ ## Mensajes de ejemplo

= ## Example messages
=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with message, NullPointerException
+ [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with message, NullPointerException

= [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with message, NullPointerException
- ```
+ ```

= ```
=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with no message
+ [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with no message

= [↯/s.15.1] unchecked error with no message
- ```
+ ```

- ## Resolution
+ ## Solución

- Identify the underlying `Throwable` (`getCause` chain) and decide
- whether to surface it as a typed Soundness error or fix the source
- to avoid the foreign throw.
+ Identifica el `Throwable` subyacente (la cadena de `getCause`) y decide si debe aflorar como un
+ error de Soundness con tipo o si hay que corregir el código fuente para evitar el lanzamiento
+ ajeno.

